Z||000008||olliver||10-31-2001||01:14 PM||||Speaking of t.c's i have a 2750 stall speed on my '86 GT.  I tell you when I launch at 2700 there's not too much that can take me on my hole shot.  But like it was mentioned before you sacrifice gas mileage.  At 100km/h or 60mp/h it's revving at like 3300.  But do you want it to go fast or do you want to drive a piece of wood?<BR>That my friend is the $1,000,000 question!<P>Olliver<BR>||||reg||1
